{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわあ（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ−だよ？まにだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/18/5413160/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどん寒くなってきましたね（＾_＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもさ,ピークに寒いのって来月だよねえ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はまだ体調こわしてないよ❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も手洗いうがいして，後は風邪なんか引いてたまるかっ！って気持ちで頑張ってね？わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そ−いえばさ−,Xmas24と25何して過ごしたかblogに書いてなかったよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24日はね。 あみと2人でずっとデート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/18/5413160/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恵比寿で待ち合わせでイルミネーション見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六本木に移動して かずみにオススメされたお店でご飯食べて,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっからずぅ～っと綺麗なイルミネーション見ながらぶらぶらお散歩❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女2人のXmasだけど本当楽しかった（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/18/5413160/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い冬の夜は ブルー系よりレッド系のイルミネーションの方が暖かく感じて好き.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/18/5413160/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徹子さんの部屋にもお邪魔してきました❤️わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/18/5413160/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして25日はせっちゃんとディズニーの駅にあるイクスピアリでまったりして,その後せっちゃん家にお邪魔して めっちゃまったりしてました（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らない間に寝てたみたいです❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/18/5413160/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってお布団が気持ちよかってんもん。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんだいすきーっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せちゃんは私の親友です.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/18/5413160/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあこれから握手会なので,そろそろ行ってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね～（＾ω＾）"}],"source":"archive"}